Vendored Lucide geometry, tag 1.62.0, commit 03f11e2d6adc319ea21e9a1d5820a99cd3767257
Source: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/tree/03f11e2d6adc319ea21e9a1d5820a99cd3767257

Arrow up/down: row movement and sort direction; arrow-up-down: unsorted column.
Trash: row removal (upstream renamed trash-2 to trash); x: tag removal; plus: add tag.
Star: rating. Row/tag/sort icons render at 16 px; rating stars at 24 px.
Decorative SVGs inherit currentColor; accessible names belong to their controls.
The 1.62.0 LICENSE explicitly lists arrow-up, arrow-down, trash, x and plus
as inherited Feather geometry, under its included MIT licence. Arrow-up-down
and star are not in that list. LICENSE below is reproduced exactly as shipped;
FEATHER-LICENSE repeats its MIT section, rather than an unrelated Feather tag.
Geometry is reproduced without alteration in src/components/icons.rs.

